<section class="section difference-section">
  <div class="shell difference-grid">
    <div class="difference-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Why education matters</p><h2>One opportunity can set <em>more in motion.</em></h2><p>Education can help young people develop knowledge, confidence and choices for the future. When families and communities are supported too, those possibilities can reach further.</p><a class="text-link" href="#support">Be part of what comes next <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    <div class="difference-list">
      <div class="difference-item"><span class="difference-icon" aria-hidden="true">01</span><div><h3>Keep learning within reach</h3><p>Practical assistance can help address barriers that make school participation harder.</p></div></div>
      <div class="difference-item"><span class="difference-icon" aria-hidden="true">02</span><div><h3>Encourage a young person’s ambition</h3><p>Mentorship gives learners space to ask questions, set goals and feel supported.</p></div></div>
      <div class="difference-item"><span class="difference-icon" aria-hidden="true">03</span><div><h3>Invest in community potential</h3><p>Skills and education help young people contribute to stronger, more self-reliant communities.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
